schema CommitmentRecord
generation economic-1
authority engine/core/src/commitment.c
absorbs components/BonfyreControlPlane/commitment_graph.py

field commitment_id
  type text
  role identity
  required true

field committer
  type text
  role obligor
  required true

field beneficiary
  type text
  role beneficiary
  required true

field resource
  type text
  role promised-resource
  required true

field enactment
  type text
  role protocol-contract-ref
  default ""

state open discharged delegated violated compensated
transition open discharged delegated violated
transition delegated discharged violated
transition violated discharged compensated

invariant state-is-append-only
  statement current state is the last CommitmentEvent; no transition overwrites history

invariant delegation-keeps-obligor
  statement delegation creates a separate open commitment and leaves the original live

forbidden_inference commitment -> resource delivered
forbidden_inference expiry-passing -> violation
forbidden_inference compensation -> violation did not happen
